Save or delete a category rule and apply its unchanged preview

Usage: mxr rules category-apply [OPTIONS] --preview-token <PREVIEW_TOKEN> [RULE]

Arguments:
  [RULE]

Options:
      --form <FORM>
      --preview-token <PREVIEW_TOKEN>
      --delete
  -h, --help                           Print help
